For code that handles patient or clinical data, follow the privacy and AI-safety boundaries in `AGENTS.md`. Keep PHI/PII out of logs, Sentry, fixtures, and external prompts; use the canonical backend masker and frontend scrubber. Backend contracts own clinical and persistence decisions.
